    quarter turn around a Cartesian axis.

    Examples
    --------
    >>> from symbolica.community import hep
    >>> rotation = hep.Rotation.quarter_turn(hep.Axis.Z)
    >>> rotated = rotation.apply_three(hep.ThreeMomentum(1.0, 0.0, 0.0))
    """
