    >>> second = hep.ThreeMomentum(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)
    >>> assert momentum.pt == 5.0

    Parameters
    ----------
    px : float
        Momentum component along the x axis.
    py : float
        Momentum component along the y axis.
    pz : float
        Momentum component along the z axis.
